download_xet.ps1	PowerShell wrapper: venv setup, pip install, invokes the client
download_xet_client.py	Download logic (Hub URL resolution, Xet snapshot_download with per-file fallback and retry)

Run on Windows:
                powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\download_xet.ps1

Optionally with a URL: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\download_xet.ps1 "https://huggingface.co/..."

Prerequisite: Python on PATH (for python -m venv).
